16:+ * 120 fps and counting lines missing across the screen. 3.2 to 9.5 ms after the
17:+ * edge had none in 39 updates; 15.8 and 1.1 ms had a seam, about 5 ms either
18:+ * side of the pulse. 7.4 ms is the middle of the clean 12 ms. It holds for a
